mpress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5611e1cdebf52f8fa93cb4399fd72801", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0498bba8/uploads/origins/618e8183-7df1-488d-9860-9578de8b5877?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5611e1cdebf52f8fa93cb4399fd72801, https://si.imgix.net/0498bba8/uploads/origins/618e8183-7df1-488d-9860-9578de8b5877?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94b2dfa7735bfae31f04f740cc31ef03 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0498bba8/uploads/origins/618e8183-7df1-488d-9860-9578de8b5877?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=23f849be4b5c926727123615137c1bfe 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Some time ago you drew my version of Inanna for me (https://skeb.jp/@yudai_hachino/works/1). Now I’d like to request my version of her twin brother, the sun god Utu. I’d like him to wear similar clothes, though with a sun symbol on his tiara instead of the Venus star, and with the position of the outer garment mirrored, so that his left leg is visible instead of the right one. I’d also like the overall composition to be mirrored, except for the pose of his arms. I leave that up to you (I've included some historical art for inspiration), I’d only like him to hold his saw in his right hand, since it’s his recurring attribute. I'd like his hair and beard to resemble my sketch, as opposed to the longer beard from historical art - the idea is that the six locks of hair and beard make the silhouette of his head look like a simple drawing of the sun. I'd like him to have a serene, happy expression.\n\nI’d like Utu’s hair and skin tone to be the same as Inanna’s, but his clothing should be colored slightly differently, with no blue (except for the single bracelet) and more yellow and orange tones instead of red. Similarly, if possible I'd like the background to mostly feature warm tones to reflect that he's a sun god. However, keeping white as the main color of the clothing is fine.\n\nI'm fine with any necessary price adjustments.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WuxT9phD84LTgZc04aVvvrhNgyvU-12Y?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yudai_hachino/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1290570, "client_id": 352552, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a2b5ccbaa4ee8d82d78bde6d80b7636", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a2b5ccbaa4ee8d82d78bde6d80b7636, https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00417de6ec9fc900c15d777d9fff23e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ee5073ae9ed15720fa0f4931b3fc585 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=68d8d9a10e9709df57a89f57de9b8eba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=68d8d9a10e9709df57a89f57de9b8eba, https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=60b810116f85d4527ee874f80d966ea3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f57f5553/uploads/origins/1114020f-fa34-491b-b58e-bc9a1aecda25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=703ab2e34472ae08f095e911922e7d0a 3x"}, "body": "Hello again! I really like the Nanaya picture you drew for me! I’d love it if you could draw her again, but this time in a slightly different outfit, based on her depictions from central Asia. I’d like her to have only two arms and the same skin tone as before, though, in contrast with the Sogdian painting I’ve included for reference. I’d like the robe to look similar as in the painting (please include the two stars on her chest). It should almost reach her ankles, but with enough left exposed for the same anklet as last time to be visible. Other jewelry can resemble the painting. I would like the two small orbs floating above her to have Mesopotamian moon and sun symbols in them, and I’d also like Nanaya herself to have a small simple golden sun and silver crescent as makeup on her cheeks. I’ve also included a pose reference (it’s a statuette of Nanaya); as for the expression, it can be similar to the previous picture.\n\nI'm fine with any necessary price adjustments.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HbfMVhvxGF30hAvTnDqeWhx5pvL5rRy2?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yudai_hachino/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1290570, "client_id": 1475518, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a131ae9bebca9e858c5716934e07a82b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a131ae9bebca9e858c5716934e07a82b, https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec733051bfc0bf50c9de1af21dadc4b5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=669408f31ddbbde9c62472efa9cf94bb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a0487ea49806c87888b7fc7957227fd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a0487ea49806c87888b7fc7957227fd, https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e0eec344cd0698a4eb891d091bb8114 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42eb226d/uploads/origins/5e348f7f-9f25-4b6f-9c22-d442ace3e75e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dbd801c7508539d07b39e81a6c347772 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！はじめまして！\n\nあなたの作品が大好きなので、私のキャラクター「ベンジャミン」のイラストをお願いしたいです。彼は社交的で、賢く、親切で、反骨精神があり、ちょっと無鉄砲な男です。でも、トラブルからは巧みに切り抜けるのが得意で、どんな挑戦にも決意に満ちた笑顔を浮かべて立ち向かいます。 身長は186cmです。スリムでアスリートのような体格をしています。目は濃い緑色で、髪は太く濃い茶色です。\n吸血鬼になってまだ日が浅く、必ずしも簡単ではないものの、この新しい生活様式に慣れようとしています。 血への渇望にひどく苦しむこともあれば、かつての普通の生活を失ったことに対する悲しみ、苦悩、そして憤りを感じることもあります。\n吸血鬼になったばかりの、まだ葛藤していた頃の彼を描いても構いませんし、吸血鬼としての現実を受け入れ、再び幸せと安らぎを見出した後の彼を描いても構いません。\n\nご検討いただき、誠にありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dKLArmsmF0Izq_uu2CjP8q5KkUpt2mz8?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yudai_hachino/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": fal